M140 S100 ; set bed temp
M190 S100 ; wait for bed temp
M109 S255 ; wait for extruder temp
G28 W ; home all without mesh bed level
G80 X82.6229 Y96.1229 W84.7542 H17.7542 ; mesh bed levelling

G1 Z0.2 F720
